       [-1., -0.]]

  operator.shape
  ==> [2, 2]

  operator.log_abs_determinant()
  ==> scalar Tensor

  x = ... Shape [2, 4] Tensor
  operator.matmul(x)
  ==> Shape [2, 4] Tensor
  ```

